   "name": "a-fractional-start-offset-starts-at-the-d55-placement",
   "note": "R88 (D67 item 7): 16 * 1234.5104 = 19752.1664 rounds half away from zero to session sample 19752, and 96000 frames at 48 kHz are 32000 samples, so the extent is [19752, 51752). The gap stays on the session timeline: [ceil(16 * 1984.5104), ceil(16 * 2084.5104)) = [ceil(31752.1664), ceil(33352.1664)) = [31753, 33353). The raw offset would give [19753, 31753) and [33353, 51753).",
